OL,3,AHow does the UK state pension compare
OL,4,Awith other countries?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGetting older is something few of us
OL,7,Fwant to think about. Yet how we fund
OL,8,Four later years, and how much we'll
OL,9,Fget, has been a hot topic.
OL,11,FThe triple lock formula - state
OL,12,Fpensions increasing by the greatest of
OL,13,F2.5%, earnings growth, or inflation -
OL,14,Fmeans those benefits have risen far
OL,15,Ffaster than the earnings of workers
OL,16,Fsince its introduction in 2011.
OL,18,FBut as housing costs have also been
OL,19,Frising fast, pensioner poverty has
OL,20,Factually increased slightly in the last
OL,21,Fdecade.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
