OL,3,AHow does the UK state pension compare
OL,4,Awith other countries?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNevertheless, even if you take those
OL,7,Fcosts into consideration, pensioners
OL,8,Fare less likely to be in relative
OL,9,Fpoverty - that is, having to get by on
OL,10,Fless than 60% of the income of the
OL,11,Ftypical household - than families with
OL,12,Fchildren or working-age people.
